# A copy of Kiki-Jiki's token copies its copiable values, the Llanowar Elves "except it has haste" (CR 707.9b; the ruling: "If
# another creature ... enters the battlefield as a copy of, the token, that creature will copy the creature card the token is
# copying, except it will also have haste. However, you won't sacrifice the new copy"). Phyrexian Metamorph enters as a copy
# of the token: an artifact Llanowar Elves with haste, tapped for mana the turn it arrives. At the end step only the token is
# sacrificed; the Metamorph stays.

